step Watcher Dodds
  tip Head back east along the road to the Yorgen Farmstead.
  turnin 245

step Yorgen Farmstead
  tip The mound of loose dirt lies south of the farmhouse, by the old stump.
  turnin 95                               -- Mound of loose dirt
  accept 230

step Darkshire
  turnin 96139                            -- Sirra Von'Indi, inside
  turnin 5                                -- Chef Grual, in the Scarlet Raven Tavern
  turnin 56                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  accept 57
  level 23
  accept 173                              -- Calor, by the town hall

step Madame Eva
  turnin 101                              -- Madame Eva, inside
  turnin 148
  accept 149
  vendor nearest optional

step Redridge Mountains
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Back north along the road from Darkshire to Three Corners.
  goto 15.3,71.5 "Redridge Mountains"

step Lakeridge Highway
  tip Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Guard Howe stands by the road next to her.
  getfp "Lakeshire"
  accept 128                                  -- Guard Howe

step Lake Everstill's murlocs: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore of Lake Everstill, just east of the gryphons and the bridge. Any of them can carry a fin.
  collect 1468 quest 150                      -- Murloc Fin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lakeshire
  tip Cross the long bridge north into town: Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, the innkeeper in the inn, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end. Marshal Marris's Blackrock quests and Alther's Mill came with you from your first Redridge visit.
  turnin 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  accept 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall
  sethome "Lakeshire"
  accept 180                                  -- The Wanted poster by the inn
  accept 34                                   -- Martie Jainrose

step Bellygrub
  tip Bellygrub (level 24) roots around the pen just west of Lakeshire, beside Martie's garden. Pull him away from the other boars and fight at full health.
  collect 3631 quest 34                       -- Bellygrub's Tusk

step Martie Jainrose
  tip Martie's garden is at the west end of town.
  turnin 34

step Lakeshire
  tip Back east through town from Martie's garden: two Wanted posters hang on the town hall doorway.
  accept 169 optional                         -- The Wanted poster on the town hall doorway
  accept 95999 optional                       -- The Wanted poster beside it
  vendor nearest optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of the lake

step Lake Everstill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around the mill north-east of the lake.
  kill 505 quest 98386                        -- Greater Tarantula

step Blackrock camps
  tip South-east from the mill, west of Galardell Valley's gnolls, to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep. Renegades, Grunts and Outrunners fill them; keep east of the keep, whose orcs are elite. Weapon racks and swords lie about the camps; meat haunches, grain sacks and water barrels hold the supplies.
  collect 3014 quest 20 @71,70.5 map 1433 live -- Battleworn Axe
  collect 280841 quest 98387 @68.3,79.4 map 1433 live -- Stolen Weapon: weapon racks and swords on the ground
  collect 280839 quest 98387 @67.4,78.9 map 1433 live -- Blackrock Supplies: meat haunches, grain sacks, water barrels

step Incinerator Gar'im
  tip Gar'im keeps to the cave at the camps' south end with his imp and two orcs. Elite: group up if you can; solo, pull the orcs at the mouth first and interrupt his fire cast.
  collect 271872 quest 95999 optional         -- Broken Staff of Incinerator Gar'im

step Galardell Valley
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip North up the valley's east side. Shadowhide gnolls fill it; Lieutenant Fangore (26) and his two guards stand at its north end: clear the gnolls around him first and fight at full health. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the west until the watch tower: its orcs are elite.
  collect 1075 quest 91                       -- Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll
  collect 3632 quest 180                      -- Fangore's Paw

step A Watchful Eye
  tip The Old Lion Statue stands at the valley's east edge.
  turnin 94
  accept 248

step Looking Further
  tip West to the intact watch tower beside Stonewatch Keep: climb it and leave the Glyph in the empty jar at the top.
  turnin 248

step Stonewatch Keep
  tip The keep stands beside the tower. Gath'Ilzogg (elite) waits in the keep's top room with two guards and a dragon; Blackrock Shadowcasters (elite) and Sentries stand on its west side, so pull one at a time on the way in, and hug the right wall as you enter his room so you don't pull him at once. Elite: group up if you can.
  collect 3633 quest 169 optional             -- Head of Gath'Ilzogg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Render's Valley

step Render's Valley
  tip From the keep head back west along the lake's north shore and north up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley; Lakeshire's hand-ins wait for Keeshan's escort, which ends there. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley.
  kill 435 quest 128                          -- Blackrock Champion, below ground

step Corporal Keeshan
  tip Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way.
  accept 219                                  -- Corporal Keeshan, below ground
  complete 219

step Back to Lakeshire
  tip Into Lakeshire from the north with Keeshan: Bailiff Conacher and Magistrate Solomon in the town hall, Marshal Marris and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, then over the bridge to Guard Howe and the gryphons.
  turnin 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall
  turnin 180                                  -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall
  turnin 169 optional
  turnin 95999 optional
  turnin 219                                  -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 20
  turnin 98387
  turnin 98386                                -- Foreman Oslow
  turnin 128                                  -- Guard Howe, by the gryphons south of the bridge
  note Next: the gryphon to Darkshire for Duskwood's second loop (05-duskwood).
